{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"scorchwing","model_identifier":"scorchwing","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# scorchwing\n\nScorchwing (C2), low flyer, 1.6 m = 57 u tall standing (horns to 58 u), 3.1 m (112 u) wingspan.\n\nA red bat-winged demon: lean cracked red body, bat wings of dark red membrane on arm and finger bones with glowing orange trailing edges (glow_edge_* cubes), a black hooked beak with a lower beak on `jaw`, short swept horns, a long tail with a black spade tip, digitigrade legs with black talons and burning yellow eyes. Rig: root > body > chest > neck > head > jaw, tail_1-3, wing_* > wing_mid_* > wing_tip_*, leg_* > shin_* > foot_*.\n\n- Cubes: 42 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -55.5..55.5, y 0.0..58.0, z -16.5..40.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- in flight: one box 30 x 14 x 50 (w x h x d) around the body (wings excluded); on the ground: 16 x 57 x 20\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3 | loop | crouched on the ground, wings half folded behind the shoulders |\n| `walk` | 0.8 | loop |  |\n| `fly` | 0.7 | loop | flapping flight (loop), body near horizontal, legs and tail trailing |\n| `swoop` | 1.3 | once | key 0.65 s: talons rake at the bottom of the dive |\n| `drop_fire` | 1.2 | once | key 0.6 s: head snaps down, fire falls from fx_fire (beak) onto the ground below |\n| `aggro` | 1.4 | once | wings raised, beak gaping (ground) |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once |  |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | crumples onto its side, wings splayed; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 35.6 u/s (1.00 m/s), cycle 0.8 s, 28.4 u per cycle (hopping walk on the ground)\n- `fly`: flap 0.7 s per beat; designed for about 7 m/s (250 u/s) low flight (2-4 m up)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `swoop`: key 0.65 s: talons rake at the bottom of the dive\n- `drop_fire`: key 0.6 s: head snaps down, fire falls from fx_fire (beak) onto the ground below\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `fx_fire` on `head` at (0, 50.5, -14)\n- `slot_carry` on `body` at (0, 18, -2)\n\n## Notes\n\n- Fly clips lift the body 4.0 u so trailing parts stay above the model origin; the game sets the real altitude.\n- `fx_fire` (beak tip, on the head bone): drop_fire origin.\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l, glow_edge_* and glow_crack_chest are the lit cubes.\n- slot_carry (under the body) is spare, unused.\n"},"description":"# scorchwing\n\nScorchwing (C2), low flyer, 1.6 m = 57 u tall standing (horns to 58 u), 3.1 m (112 u) wingspan.\n\nA red bat-winged demon: lean cracked red body, bat wings of dark red membrane on arm and finger bones with glowing orange trailing edges (glow_edge_* cubes), a black hooked beak with a lower beak on `jaw`, short swept horns, a long tail with a black spade tip, digitigrade legs with black talons and burning yellow eyes. Rig: root > body > chest > neck > head > jaw, tail_1-3, wing_* > wing_mid_* > wing_tip_*, leg_* > shin_* > foot_*.\n\n- Cubes: 42 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -55.5..55.5, y 0.0..58.0, z -16.5..40.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- in flight: one box 30 x 14 x 50 (w x h x d) around the body (wings excluded); on the ground: 16 x 57 x 20\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3 | loop | crouched on the ground, wings half folded behind the shoulders |\n| `walk` | 0.8 | loop |  |\n| `fly` | 0.7 | loop | flapping flight (loop), body near horizontal, legs and tail trailing |\n| `swoop` | 1.3 | once | key 0.65 s: talons rake at the bottom of the dive |\n| `drop_fire` | 1.2 | once | key 0.6 s: head snaps down, fire falls from fx_fire (beak) onto the ground below |\n| `aggro` | 1.4 | once | wings raised, beak gaping (ground) |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once |  |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | crumples onto its side, wings splayed; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 35.6 u/s (1.00 m/s), cycle 0.8 s, 28.4 u per cycle (hopping walk on the ground)\n- `fly`: flap 0.7 s per beat; designed for about 7 m/s (250 u/s) low flight (2-4 m up)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `swoop`: key 0.65 s: talons rake at the bottom of the dive\n- `drop_fire`: key 0.6 s: head snaps down, fire falls from fx_fire (beak) onto the ground below\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `fx_fire` on `head` at (0, 50.5, -14)\n- `slot_carry` on `body` at (0, 18, -2)\n\n## Notes\n\n- Fly clips lift the body 4.0 u so trailing parts stay above the model origin; the game sets the real altitude.\n- `fx_fire` (beak tip, on the head bone): drop_fire origin.\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l, glow_edge_* and glow_crack_chest are the lit cubes.\n- slot_carry (under the body) is spare, unused.\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"pelvis","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-4.5,22.0,-3.0],"to":[4.5,31.0,3.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,26.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[16,33,25.0,42.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[34,33,40.5,42.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[25,33,34.0,42.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[41,33,47.5,42.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[54,44,63.0,50.5],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[63,44,72.0,50.5],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"dbe1c307-ed04-5d35-9ac2-b9825bd5481c"},{"name":"chest","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-5.5,31.0,-4.0],"to":[5.5,47.0,4.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,31.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[68,0,79.0,16.0],"texture":0},"east":{"u